---
---

<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 reveal-on-scroll">
  <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-sans font-extrabold text-[#1b3825]">
      Spesialisasi Acara di Malang & Kediri
    </h2>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#546b5a] mt-2">
      Memahami karakteristik venue, iklim perizinan, dan rantai vendor terpercaya di dua kota pusat Jawa Timur.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
    
    <!-- Malang Card -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-[2rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#e2ece4] shadow-xs hover:border-[#2d553b] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-[#2d553b] text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full">
            Hub Utama
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs text-[#5c7763] font-medium">Malang Raya & Kota Batu</span>
        </div>

        <div class="relative w-full h-48 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-5">
          <img
            src="/images/corporate-malang.jpg"
            alt="Event Organizer Malang - Konferensi dan Seminar"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-3 left-4 text-white">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-sans">Event Organizer Malang</h3>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4b6352] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Layanan penyelenggaraan acara terdepan di Kota Malang dan Kota Wisata Batu. Ideal untuk corporate retreat, seminar universitas, awarding night hotel bintang lima, dan intimate garden wedding di lereng pegunungan.
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-2 mb-6">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#2f4937]">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#2d553b] shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Jaringan venue hotel (Grand Mercure, Savana, Kusuma Agrowisata Batu)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#2f4937]">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#2d553b] shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Fasilitator outbound & gathering bersertifikat di pegunungan Batu</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#2f4937]">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#2d553b] shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Sistem registrasi barcode cepat untuk seminar skala 500+ peserta</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-[#edf4ee] flex items-center justify-between">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#2d553b]">Kantor: Jl. Besar Ijen No. 42</span>
        <a
          href="/layanan"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-[#2d553b] hover:bg-[#1a3825] text-white text-xs font-bold transition-all shadow-xs"
        >
          <span>Lihat Layanan Terpadu</span>
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Kediri Card -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-[2rem] p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#e2ece4] shadow-xs hover:border-[#2d553b] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-[#2d553b] text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full">
            Hub Operasional
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs text-[#5c7763] font-medium">Kota & Kab. Kediri</span>
        </div>

        <div class="relative w-full h-48 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-5">
          <img
            src="/images/kediri-gala.jpg"
            alt="Event Organizer Kediri - Corporate Awarding dan Gala Dinner"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-3 left-4 text-white">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-sans">Event Organizer Kediri</h3>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4b6352] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Mendukung kemajuan industri, korporasi manufaktur, perayaan pernikahan megah, dan festival kreatif di Kediri seiring akselerasi konektivitas Bandara Dhoho Kediri.
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-2 mb-6">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#2f4937]">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#2d553b] shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Produksi panggung ballroom hotel & venue konvensi Grand Surya Kediri</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#2f4937]">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#2d553b] shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Manajemen perizinan keramaian festival musik & pameran terbuka</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#2f4937]">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#2d553b] shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Logistik sound system line-array & lighting panggung siap di Kediri</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-[#edf4ee] flex items-center justify-between">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#2d553b]">Hub: Jl. Dhoho No. 88</span>
        <a
          href="/layanan"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-[#2d553b] hover:bg-[#1a3825] text-white text-xs font-bold transition-all shadow-xs"
        >
          <span>Lihat Layanan Terpadu</span>
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
